      "versionNonce": 2067134501,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769943781455,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements :",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements :",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BizTWdVW6Oco8cMEzoSJo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 815.2801208496094,
      "y": 312,
      "width": 491.72760009765625,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1215280357,
      "version": 1143,
      "versionNonce": 1649925061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769944093874,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Strong consistency for the seating process.\nACID guarantees should be present and seat should\nnot be double booked.\n\n2. High availability - System should have 99% uptime\nfor browsing and booking paths\n\n3. Scalable - Should be scalable to handle burst traffic\nof 1M+ concurrent users, 100K seat view requests/second and \n10K write transactions/second\n\n4. Fairness - Strict first come first server order processing\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Strong consistency for the seating process.\nACID guarantees should be present and seat should\nnot be double booked.\n\n2. High availability - System should have 99% uptime\nfor browsing and booking paths\n\n3. Scalable - Should be scalable to handle burst traffic\nof 1M+ concurrent users, 100K seat view requests/second and \n10K write transactions/second\n\n4. Fairness - Strict first come first server order processing\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
