      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Table Description \n1. All the events are stored in the event table which contains the id, the venue the event is happening, name, start time,\nduration and status\n2. Venue represents a core place where the event is going to take place\n3. And for all the seats in the venue, they would be represent by the Seats table. However\n4. All the seats can be priced differently and can be booked or un-booked which would be represented by Event Seats, and finally\n5. Bookings would hold the booking id, who booked, the seats booked, price paid, booking succeeded / failed / cancelled etc",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Table Description \n1. All the events are stored in the event table which contains the id, the venue the event is happening, name, start time,\nduration and status\n2. Venue represents a core place where the event is going to take place\n3. And for all the seats in the venue, they would be represent by the Seats table. However\n4. All the seats can be priced differently and can be booked or un-booked which would be represented by Event Seats, and finally\n5. Bookings would hold the booking id, who booked, the seats booked, price paid, booking succeeded / failed / cancelled etc",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
