      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 1491049957,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769945583005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Design",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Design",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7PKd7XftYSZq8aXth972j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 431,
      "y": 1965,
      "width": 657.79150390625,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 413191173,
      "version": 773,
      "versionNonce": 2080937035,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769946314237,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We will use a classic REST based approach for interacting with our booking system\n\n1. GET Events : /api/events?query={...}\nSearches events in Elastic Search\n\n2. GET Events : /api/events/{id}/availability\nWill return a map of seat ids, with 0 being free and 1 being taken\n\n3. POST : /api/bookings/reserve\nPayload : event_id, List<Seat_ids>\nResponse : {Booking id, Status} or Error (if seats taken or booking fails)\n\n4. POST : /api/bookings/{id}/payment\nThis is used to process payments, and we will simply return the Payment Token here\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We will use a classic REST based approach for interacting with our booking system\n\n1. GET Events : /api/events?query={...}\nSearches events in Elastic Search\n\n2. GET Events : /api/events/{id}/availability\nWill return a map of seat ids, with 0 being free and 1 being taken\n\n3. POST : /api/bookings/reserve\nPayload : event_id, List<Seat_ids>\nResponse : {Booking id, Status} or Error (if seats taken or booking fails)\n\n4. POST : /api/bookings/{id}/payment\nThis is used to process payments, and we will simply return the Payment Token here\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
