      "text": "LB is used to distribute HTTP Requests,\nacross Availability Zones.\nAPI Gateway is responsible for authentication \nand auth using JWT Tokens.\nWill have rate limiting and validation of requests\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LB is used to distribute HTTP Requests,\nacross Availability Zones.\nAPI Gateway is responsible for authentication \nand auth using JWT Tokens.\nWill have rate limiting and validation of requests\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
